// The curated catalog of competition groups.
//
// A group is the recurring track a competition instance belongs to. It is what
// separates a Major season's 1st place from a Minor season's 1st place even
// when BBL and TP label them identically, and it is what lets the TP awards
// importer (tools/import-tp/src/trophy-awards/) consider only the trophies
// applicable to a competition.
//
// Every group names its league by that league's own external id, resolved
// against the database through the API's resolve procedure -- the group only
// needs the league to have been imported by some earlier run or phase, not
// necessarily this one. leagues.json5 sits in this same directory so that,
// within a fresh database's first run, it is imported ahead of these groups.
//
// A group carries no authored external ids: one is derived in code from its
// name under the synthetic "Name" system (declared below so the run
// bootstraps it), which is how the same group resolves onto the same row from
// any importer process.
//
// Naming notes:
//  - "Major Season" also covers BBL's pre-split "Season N" (1-18) and TP's
//    later Swedish "Säsong N" (26-30): one recurring track under three names
//    over time.
//  - "GBBL" is a one-off with a single known instance, but still gets its own
//    group, consistent with every other named cup, and it belongs to the GBBL
//    league rather than tLoEG.
//  - "Cabal Vision Cup" is deliberately absent from this catalog despite
//    naming a real curated trophy (see trophies.json5): in the actual BBL
//    data it is only ever awarded within Minor Season competitions (bblId 57
//    and 60), never in a competition or match of its own, so the trophy is
//    curated under "Minor Season" rather than a dedicated group.
//
// Name patterns: `namePattern` is a regular expression (compiled with flags
// `iu` -- case-insensitive, Unicode-aware) that TP competition import matches
// a brand-new competition's RAW source name against. Exactly one group's
// pattern matching makes that the new competition's group, names it
// "<group name> <highest existing number + 1>", and takes the type every
// existing competition in the group shares. Every historical naming variant
// of a track goes into its one pattern as alternation (e.g. Major Season's
// "Season N" / "Major Season N" / "tLoEGBBL Säsong N"), and each pattern is
// anchored so it cannot claim another track's names (Major Season's must not
// match "Minor Season N" or "Dungeon Bowl Season N"). The one-offs -- Fright
// Night, Snöbollskrieg, Champion of tLoEG, Blitzmania! -- deliberately have
// none, so a new competition is never auto-classified into them. The real
// historical names every pattern must (and must not) match are pinned in
// packages/import-tp-live/src/competition/tp-competition-group-name-patterns.spec.ts;
// update that test alongside any pattern change.
{
  externalSystems: [
    { name: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', category: 'imported_data_source' },
    { name: 'Name', category: 'bookkeeping' },
  ],
  competitionGroups: [
    {
      name: 'Major Season',
      league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' },
      namePattern: '^(?:tLoEGBBL[\\s-]*)?(?:Major Season|Season|Säsong)\\s*\\d+$',
    },
    {
      name: 'Minor Season',
      league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' },
      namePattern: '^(?:tLoEGBBL[\\s-]*)?(?:Minor Season|Korpen)\\s*\\d+$',
    },
    {
      name: 'Chaos Cup',
      league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' },
      namePattern: '^(?:tLoEGBBL[\\s-]*)?Chaos Cup(?:\\s*\\d+)?$',
    },
    {
      name: 'Stunty Leeg',
      league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' },
      namePattern: '^(?:tLoEGBBL[\\s-]*)?Stunty Leeg(?:\\s*\\d+)?$',
    },
    { name: 'Fright Night', league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' } },
    { name: 'Snöbollskrieg', league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' } },
    {
      name: 'Moot Mania',
      league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' },
      namePattern: '^(?:tLoEGBBL[\\s-]*)?Moot Mania(?:\\s*\\d+)?$',
    },
    { name: 'Champion of tLoEG', league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' } },
    {
      name: 'NAA',
      league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' },
      namePattern: '^(?:tLoEGBBL[\\s-]*)?NAA(?:\\s*\\d+)?$',
    },
    { name: 'Blitzmania!', league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' } },
    {
      name: 'Ogretoberfest',
      league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' },
      // TP once wrapped it in dashes: "-OGRETOBERFEST 12 -"; BBL once dropped
      // the space: "Ogretoberfest10".
      namePattern: '^[\\s-]*(?:tLoEGBBL[\\s-]*)?Ogretoberfest(?:\\s*\\d+)?[\\s-]*$',
    },
    {
      name: 'Dungeon Bowl',
      league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' },
      // TP: "tLoEGBBL - Dungeon Bowl Season N"; BBL: "Dungeon Bowl 1".
      namePattern: '^(?:tLoEGBBL[\\s-]*)?Dungeon Bowl(?:\\s+Season)?(?:\\s*\\d+)?$',
    },
    {
      name: 'Reserves Rumble',
      league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'tLoEG' },
      namePattern: '^(?:tLoEGBBL[\\s-]*)?Reserves Rumble(?:\\s*\\d+)?$',
    },
    {
      name: 'GBBL',
      league: { system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'GBBL' },
      // Anchored at the start so "tLoEGBBL ..." names never match.
      namePattern: '^GBBL(?:\\s*\\d+)?$',
    },
  ],
}
